# Nothing the image installs or serves lives in notebooks/tests/docs — the
# API installs showcase-api's subtree and reads only projects/*/reports*
# (plus story/portfolio/demo.yaml), so keep the fat out of the build context.
docs
**/notebooks
**/tests
# NOTE: no re-include for projects/01-rag-agent/data/index — the image no
